     "t": "code",
     "text": "====================================================================================================\nCHALKBOARD VISUAL LAYOUT \u2014 SLIDE 0007\n====================================================================================================\n                  +-----------------+\n                  |   Multiplier    |\n  \\alpha(t) ----->|       (X)       |--------------------+\n                  +--------^--------+                    |\n                           |                             v\n                          x(t)                 +-------------------+\n                                               |  \\int_{T_0} . dt  |-----> Output = ?\n                                               +-------------------+\n                                                    T_0 = 2 sec.\n\nComponent harmonic angular frequencies:\n\\omega_0 = \\pi,  2\\omega_0 = 2\\pi,  3\\omega_0 = 3\\pi,  4\\omega_0 = 4\\pi,  5\\omega_0 = 5\\pi, ...\n\nTesting Probe 1: Let \\alpha(t) = sin(\\pi t) = sin(\\omega_0 t)\n\nOutput = \\int_{T_0} x(t) . sin(\\pi t) dt\n       = \\int_2 [2 + 4 sin(3\\pi t) + 3 cos(5\\pi t)] . sin(\\pi t) dt\n       = \\int_2 2 sin(\\pi t) dt  +  \\int_2 4 sin(3\\pi t) sin(\\pi t) dt  +  \\int_2 3 cos(5\\pi t) sin(\\pi t) dt\n            |                              |                                       |\n            v                              v                                       v\n         =  0                           =  0 (orthogonal)                       =  0 (orthogonal)\n       = 0\n===================================================================================================="
