     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\int_0^2 4 \\sin^2(3\\pi t) \\, dt = 4 \\int_0^2 \\frac{1 - \\cos(6\\pi t)}{2} \\, dt = 2 \\left[ t - \\frac{\\sin(6\\pi t)}{6\\pi} \\right]_0^2 = 2 [2 - 0] = 4 \\ne 0"
