     "t": "code",
     "text": "====================================================================================================\nCHALKBOARD VISUAL LAYOUT \u2014 SLIDE 0009\n====================================================================================================\nTesting Cosine Probes:\n  \\alpha(t) = cos(\\pi t)    ===>  Output = 0\n  \\alpha(t) = cos(2\\pi t)   ===>  Output = 0\n  \\alpha(t) = cos(3\\pi t)   ===>  Output = 0\n  \\alpha(t) = cos(4\\pi t)   ===>  Output = 0\n  \\alpha(t) = cos(5\\pi t) = cos(5\\omega_0 t)  ===>  Output != 0\n\nChalkboard deduction:\n  x(t) = b_3 sin(3\\pi t)  +  a_5 cos(5\\pi t)  + ...\n===================================================================================================="
