     "text": "====================================================================================================\nCHALKBOARD VISUAL LAYOUT \u2014 SLIDE 0011\n====================================================================================================\n+-----------------------------------+\n|  Trigonometric Fourier series:-   |\n+-----------------------------------+\n                                                 a_n = ?\n  x(t) = c_0 + \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty a_n cos(n\\omega_0 t) + \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty b_n sin(n\\omega_0 t)   +-------+\n   |      |    \\______________________________________________/   | b_n = ?|\n  T_0,    DC              cosinusoid + sinusoid                   +-------+\n  \\omega_0\n\nDerivation of b_n:\nMultiply both sides by sin(n\\omega_0 t) and integrate over T_0:\n\n  \\int_{T_0} x(t) . sin(n\\omega_0 t) dt = \\int_{T_0} c_0 . sin(n\\omega_0 t) dt  (-> 0)\n                                      + \\int_{T_0} \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty a_n cos(n\\omega_0 t) . sin(n\\omega_0 t) dt (-> 0, orthogonal)\n                                      + \\int_{T_0} \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty b_n sin(n\\omega_0 t) . sin(n\\omega_0 t) dt\n===================================================================================================="
