     "text": "====================================================================================================\nCHALKBOARD VISUAL LAYOUT \u2014 SLIDE 0018\n====================================================================================================\nMaster Conversion Formulas:\n+-----------------------------------+     +-----------------------------------+\n|         a_n - j b_n               |     |         a_n + j b_n               |\n|   c_n = -----------               |     |  c_{-n} = -----------             |\n|              2                    |     |              2                    |\n+-----------------------------------+     +-----------------------------------+\n\nSynthesis Equation:\n  x(t) = ... + c_{-2} e^{-j 2\\omega_0 t} + c_{-1} e^{-j\\omega_0 t} + c_0 + c_1 e^{j\\omega_0 t} + c_2 e^{j 2\\omega_0 t} + ...\n\n+-------------------------------------+   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                \\infty               |   |                               \\infty                        |\n|   x(t) = \\sum_{n=-\\infty} c_n e^{j n\\omega_0 t} | = |   c_0 + \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty a_n cos(n\\omega_0 t) + \\sum_{n=1} b_n sin(n\\omega_0 t)   |\n+-------------------------------------+   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\n\nAnalysis Equation:\n+---------------------------------------------------+     +-----------------------------------------------------+\n|         1                                         |     |  a_n = (2 / T_0) \\int_{T_0} x(t) cos(n\\omega_0 t) dt|\n|   c_n = -- \\int_{T_0} x(t) e^{-j n\\omega_0 t} dt  |     +-----------------------------------------------------+\n|         T_0                                       |     |  b_n = (2 / T_0) \\int_{T_0} x(t) sin(n\\omega_0 t) dt|\n+---------------------------------------------------+     +-----------------------------------------------------+\n                                                          |  c_0 = (1 / T_0) \\int_{T_0} x(t) dt   (DC Value)    |\n                                                          +-----------------------------------------------------+\n===================================================================================================="
