     "t": "code",
     "text": "====================================================================================================\nCHALKBOARD VISUAL LAYOUT \u2014 SLIDE 0019\n====================================================================================================\n* Exponential Fourier Series Relations:\n\nSynthesis:\n  x(t) = \\sum_{n=-\\infty}^\\infty c_n e^{j n\\omega_0 t}\n\nAnalysis:\n  c_n = (1 / T_0) \\int_{T_0} x(t) e^{-j n\\omega_0 t} dt\n\nForward and Backward Conversion Identities:\n  c_n     = (a_n - j b_n) / 2\n  c_{-n}  = (a_n + j b_n) / 2\n\n  Adding:      c_n + c_{-n} = a_n     ===>  +-------------------+\n                                            |  a_n = c_n + c_{-n}|\n                                            +-------------------+\n\n  Subtracting: c_{-n} - c_n = j b_n   ===>  +-----------------------+\n                                            |  b_n = (c_{-n} - c_n) / j\n                                            |      = j (c_n - c_{-n})|\n                                            +-----------------------+\n\nMagnitude:\n  |c_n|    = \\sqrt{a_n^2 + b_n^2} / 2\n  |c_{-n}| = \\sqrt{a_n^2 + b_n^2} / 2 ===>  +---------------------+\n                                            |  |c_n| = |c_{-n}|   |\n                                            +---------------------+\n===================================================================================================="
