     "tex": "x_1(t) = \\sum_{n=0}^{100} \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n e^{j n \\omega_0 t}, \\quad \\text{with } \\omega_0 = \\frac{2\\pi}{50}\\text{ rad/s}"
