      "For $x(t)$ to be Even: Requires $c_n = c_{-n}$ for all $n$.",
      "Inspection: $c_1 = \\frac{1}{2} \\neq c_{-1} = 0 \\implies c_n \\neq c_{-n}$ (Even test $\\times$).",
