      "**Reality & Imaginary Analysis:**",
      "For $x(t)$ to be Real: Requires $c_n = c_{-n}^*$ for all $n$.",
      "Inspection: $c_1 = \\frac{1}{2}$, whereas $c_{-1}^* = 0^* = 0$.",
