      "At $n = 1$: $c_1 = 3j$, $c_{-1}^* = (-3j)^* = +3j \\implies c_1 = c_{-1}^*$ (Holds!).",
      "At $n = 2$: $c_2 = -j$, $c_{-2}^* = (j)^* = -j \\implies c_2 = c_{-2}^*$ (Holds!).",
      "Since $c_n = c_{-n}^*$ for ALL $n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$:"
