     "t": "math",
     "tex": "x(t) = A \\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\delta(t - n T_0) = \\frac{A}{T_0} \\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{+\\infty} e^{j n \\omega_0 t}"
