     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\Delta\\left(\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right) = \\left.\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right|_{k^+} - \\left.\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right|_{k^-} = (+\\pi) - (-\\pi) = +2\\pi"
