     "t": "code",
     "text": "Chalkboard View:\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|   \u03c9_0 = 2\u03c0      d^2x(t)/dt^2 = [Impulse Train, A -> 2\u03c0, T_0 = 1] + \u03c0^2 { -x(t) }        |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                 (jn\u03c9_0)^2 c_n = (2\u03c0 / 1) - \u03c0^2 c_n                                      |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                 -4n^2 \u03c0^2 c_n = 2\u03c0 - \u03c0^2 c_n                                            |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                 \u03c0^2 (1 - 4n^2) c_n = 2\u03c0                                                 |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                 +----------------------------+                                          |\n|                 | c_n = 2 / [ \u03c0 (1 - 4n^2) ] |                                          |\n|                 +----------------------------+                                          |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                 +-------------+   +-------------------+   +--------------------+        |\n|                 | c_0 = 2 / \u03c0 |   | c_1 = -2/(3\u03c0)=c_{-1}| | c_2= -2/(15\u03c0)=c_{-2}|       |\n|                 +-------------+   +-------------------+   +--------------------+        |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+"
